gar]]\n*¼ cup [[Cookbook:All-purpose flour|all-purpose flour]] \n*¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*¼ teaspoon ground [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]] \n*1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Each|ea]]. 9-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] unbaked deep dish [[Cookbook:Pie Crust|pastry shell]]\n\n=== Topping ===\n*½ cup white granulated sugar\n*½ cup all-purpose flour\n*¼ teaspoon ground cinnamon\n*¼ teaspoon ground [[Cookbook:Nutmeg|nutmeg]]\n*3 tablespoon cold [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]] or [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#In a bowl, combine the plums, sugar, flour, salt, cinnamon, and lemon juice. Transfer them to the pastry shell.\n#For the topping, combine the sugar, flour, cinnamon, and nutmeg in a small bowl; cut in butter until the mixture resembles coarse crumbs. Sprinkle over the pie filling.\n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at 375°F for 50–60 minutes or until bubbly and golden brown. Cover edges of crust during the last 20 minutes to prevent over-browning.\n#Cool on a wire rack.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using plum]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pies and tarts]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Purple Plum Pie","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"4 cups sliced fresh plums","sourceText":"4 cups sliced fresh plums","amountText":"4 cups sliced fresh plums","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ cup white granulated sugar","sourceText":"½ cup white granulated sugar","amountText":"½ cup white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"¼ cu